        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A roguelike, tile-based adventure on a 9-grid board where you explore, collect items, and manage your inventory strategically to prepare for automatic battles against enemies. Make every resource and turn count to survive and progress as far as you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automatic Combat</strong> – Each item activates automatically when its cooldown is complete, such as attacking enemies, applying buffs, or healing the player. Players don’t control actions directly but must manage and choose items wisely to win battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221760/extras/6096206a100b9bb7f8ede38c81df3b16.poster.avif?t=1768094335\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221760/extras/6096206a100b9bb7f8ede38c81df3b16.webm?t=1768094335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221760/extras/6096206a100b9bb7f8ede38c81df3b16.mp4?t=1768094335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Board</strong> – Each tile on the board is always randomly generated, whether it’s an event, treasure chest, shop, or weapon-upgrade spot. Players must plan ahead and make the most of each tile before it disappears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221760/extras/cc7b2c9e72149438d25b2ace9baa0d39.poster.avif?t=1768094335\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221760/extras/cc7b2c9e72149438d25b2ace9baa0d39.webm?t=1768094335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221760/extras/cc7b2c9e72149438d25b2ace9baa0d39.mp4?t=1768094335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item Levels – Identical items with the same level can be merged to increase their level. However, multiple low-level items can sometimes be more useful than a single high-level one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221760/extras/fd8dee2d5661cb3e82f134be2f6a6e6f.poster.avif?t=1768094335\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221760/extras/fd8dee2d5661cb3e82f134be2f6a6e6f.webm?t=1768094335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221760/extras/fd8dee2d5661cb3e82f134be2f6a6e6f.mp4?t=1768094335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A roguelike, tile-based adventure on a 9-grid board where you explore, collect items, and manage your inventory strategically to prepare for automatic battles against enemies. Make every resource and turn count to survive and progress as far as you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automatic Combat</strong> – Each item activates automatically when its cooldown is complete, such as attacking enemies, applying buffs, or healing the player. Players don’t control actions directly but must manage and choose items wisely to win battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221760/extras/6096206a100b9bb7f8ede38c81df3b16.poster.avif?t=1768094335\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221760/extras/6096206a100b9bb7f8ede38c81df3b16.webm?t=1768094335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221760/extras/6096206a100b9bb7f8ede38c81df3b16.mp4?t=1768094335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Board</strong> – Each tile on the board is always randomly generated, whether it’s an event, treasure chest, shop, or weapon-upgrade spot. Players must plan ahead and make the most of each tile before it disappears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221760/extras/cc7b2c9e72149438d25b2ace9baa0d39.poster.avif?t=1768094335\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221760/extras/cc7b2c9e72149438d25b2ace9baa0d39.webm?t=1768094335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221760/extras/cc7b2c9e72149438d25b2ace9baa0d39.mp4?t=1768094335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item Levels – Identical items with the same level can be merged to increase their level. However, multiple low-level items can sometimes be more useful than a single high-level one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221760/extras/fd8dee2d5661cb3e82f134be2f6a6e6f.poster.avif?t=1768094335\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221760/extras/fd8dee2d5661cb3e82f134be2f6a6e6f.webm?t=1768094335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221760/extras/fd8dee2d5661cb3e82f134be2f6a6e6f.mp4?t=1768094335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
